    "Psa",
    "Psm"
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "I waited patiently for the LORD; and he inclined unto me, and heard my cry.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "He brought me up also out of an horrible pit, out of the miry clay, and set my feet upon a rock, and established my goings.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "And he hath put a new song in my mouth, even praise unto our God: many shall see it, and fear, and shall trust in the LORD.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "Blessed is that man that maketh the LORD his trust, and respecteth not the proud, nor such as turn aside to lies.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "Many, O LORD my God, are thy wonderful works which thou hast done, and thy thoughts which are to us-ward: they cannot be reckoned up in order unto thee: if I would declare and speak of them, they are more than can be numbered.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "Sacrifice and offering thou didst not desire; mine ears hast thou opened: burnt offering and sin offering hast thou not required.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "Then said I, Lo, I come: in the volume of the book it is written of me,",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "I delight to do thy will, O my God: yea, thy law is within my heart.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "I have preached righteousness in the great congregation: lo, I have not refrained my lips, O LORD, thou knowest.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "I have not hid thy righteousness within my heart; I have declared thy faithfulness and thy salvation: I have not concealed thy lovingkindness and thy truth from the great congregation.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "Withhold not thou thy tender mercies from me, O LORD: let thy lovingkindness and thy truth continually preserve me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "For innumerable evils have compassed me about: mine iniquities have taken hold upon me, so that I am not able to look up; they are more than the hairs of mine head: therefore my heart faileth me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "Be pleased, O LORD, to deliver me: O LORD, make haste to help me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "Let them be ashamed and confounded together that seek after my soul to destroy it; let them be driven backward and put to shame that wish me evil.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "Let them be desolate for a reward of their shame that say unto me, Aha, aha.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "Let all those that seek thee rejoice and be glad in thee: let such as love thy salvation say continually, The LORD be magnified.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:40:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "But I am poor and needy; yet the Lord thinketh upon me: thou art my help and my deliverer; make no tarrying, O my God.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 40:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:40:17"
      }
    }
  ],
  "source": {
